<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Apria Healthcare lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Apria Healthcare lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities analyst Charles Boorady said he downgraded Apria Healthcare Group Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- cited expectations for a slower improvement in company's fundamentals.</p>
<p>-- lowered 1997 earnings per share estimate to $1.50 from $1.60.</p>
<p>-- shares were flat at 18.</p>
</text>
